---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Services — Revenue Systems, SEO, Paid Ads & AI Automation | Muheeb Sulaiman"
  description="Digital marketing strategy, SEO and organic growth, paid ads and performance marketing, website and funnel systems, and AI automation workflows — built for measurable revenue, not reach."
>
  <div class="services-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label">Services</div>
      <h1 class="display-lg" style="color:var(--paper); max-width:800px; margin-bottom:20px;">Not Services. Revenue Systems.</h1>
      <p>Everything I offer is designed to produce measurable, compounding revenue results — not reports, rankings, or reach.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="padding-bottom:120px;">
    <div class="services-detail-grid">
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">🎯</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Digital Marketing Strategy</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">A full-funnel growth blueprint connecting your market positioning, customer journey, and revenue targets into a coherent, executable plan. This is where we start.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Full market and competitor audit</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Customer journey mapping</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Channel strategy and prioritisation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">90-day roadmap with KPIs</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">🔍</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">SEO & Organic Growth</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">A compounding content and technical SEO system that builds traffic assets you own permanently — so you're not renting audiences from social platforms forever.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Technical SEO audit and fixes</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Keyword strategy and content architecture</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Content production system</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Link building and authority growth</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">📊</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Paid Ads & Performance Marketing</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Meta, Google, and programmatic campaigns engineered for ROAS. Every naira tracked. Every ad tested. Optimised continuously until the system prints returns.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Meta Ads (Facebook & Instagram)</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Google Search & Display</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Retargeting and lookalike systems</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Monthly reporting on true ROAS</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">🌐</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">Website & Funnel Systems</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">Conversion-focused digital infrastructure — landing pages, sales funnels, lead magnets, and booking systems — that turns traffic into qualified leads and customers.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">High-converting landing page design</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead magnet and opt-in systems</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Email and WhatsApp nurture sequences</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Booking and CRM integration</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail-card" style="grid-column:span 2;">
        <div class="service-detail-card__icon">⚡</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__title">AI & Automation Workflows</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__desc">End-to-end automation pipelines that remove repetitive, manual marketing tasks and scale your output without scaling your headcount. From lead follow-up to content production to reporting.</div>
        <div class="service-detail-card__includes" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px 32px;">
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">AI content generation workflows</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">CRM and pipeline automation</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">WhatsApp / email auto-responders</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Data aggregation and reporting</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Lead scoring and routing</div>
          <div class="service-detail-card__include">Social media scheduling systems</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <div class="cta-section__bg"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <div class="label" style="justify-content:center;">Get Started</div>
        <h2 class="display-md" style="color:var(--paper); margin-bottom:16px;">Let's Discuss Your Growth Situation</h2>
        <p>I do a free 30-minute diagnostic call for serious enquiries. No pitch. Just a clear read on your situation and what would actually move the needle.</p>
        <div class="cta-section__btns">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact"><span>→ Book Diagnostic Call</span></a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/2349110172901?text=Hi%20Muheeb%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20your%20services." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg"><span>💬 WhatsApp First</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
